        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/3ec8ea/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-11-27T17:55:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Chaosmancer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/48/1977_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Chaosmancer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>All that being said, we now know that The Blood Countess is another major power in the world. The type to get sealed for millenia because you can't beat them. That really changes how I view her…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>As an aside, I'd love to see people's listings of their opinions on who the top 10 major powers are in this world… I eat that stuff up in the Marvel / DC universes. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
